

## Use

```bash
docker run -it -d \
--name awvs \
-p 3443:3443 \
--restart=always \
ghcr.io/xrsec/awvs
# example ghcr.io/xrsec/awvs:{{tags}} # https://github.com/XRSec/AWVS-Update/pkgs/container/awvs
# ghcr.io/xrsec/awvs:v15.1
```

### Edit HOSTS

```bash
sudo vi /etc/hosts
192.168.0.1 awvs.lan
```

### RootCA 「must」

Downlaod && Install [`RootCA.cer`](https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/XRSec/AWVS-Update@main/.github/resources/ca.cer)

### Visit Web

```ini
URL: https://awvs.lan:3443/#/login
UserName: awvs@awvs.lan
PassWord: Awvs@awvs.lan
```

